{{Quote|I relieved you of the horn while you slumbered, as you had relieved him of the horn that he had relieved from Lirin Car'n, and thus made with great haste to a Scrapper I knew who would be in the market for horns, especially for golden horns of Kloo.''&raquo;<br />&laquo;''I passed out and you stole it from me.''&raquo;<br />&laquo;''I find that interpretation radiantly unkind.|translated=1|Kabe and Muftak|<ref name="The Kloo Horn Cantina Caper" />}}
'''Kabe''' was a [[Gender|female]] [[Chadra-Fan]] who was a patron of [[Chalmun's Spaceport Cantina]] shortly before the [[Battle of Yavin]].

==Biography==
{{Quote|Cute faces ain't a form of currency, Kabe.|Wuher to Kabe|<ref name="The Heist">{{IDWAdventuresCite-2017|issue=21|story=Tales from Wild Space: The Heist}}</ref>}}
[[File:KabeOverhears-SWA21.jpg|thumb|left|170px|Kabe overhears talking about a valuable item.]]
Kabe was a [[Gender|female]] [[Chadra-Fan]] who was a patron of [[Chalmun's Spaceport Cantina]].<ref name="The Kloo Horn Cantina Caper" /> At some point at Chalmun's Cantina, she tried to order [[blue milk]] from [[Wuher]], but had zero [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]]. After she overheard a conversation between two beings about an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] cruiser loaded with a valuable item aboard, Kabe eventually captured the item and exchanged it with one of the beings for credits. Kabe then bought blue milk from Wuher with those credits.<ref name="The Heist" />

In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas: Updated Edition]]'' dates the [[Secret mission to Tatooine]] to [[1 BBY]].</ref> Kabe was living with [[Muftak]] in the maintenance tunnels under Chalmun's, paying rent to [[Ackmena]] with proceeds obtained by petty theft and scams. She obtained the [[Kloo horn]] of [[Lirin D'avi]] from a [[Alcohol|drunken]] Muftak, who got it from [[Myo]], who won it from D'avi's son [[Lirin Car'n]], and pawned it to repay the debt Myo owed her and Muftak. When confronted by an angry Myo, she implicated Muftak. After several interrelated debts, including D'avi's plan to sell the horn to pay off [[Greedo]], came together, Kabe found herself likely to be killed by Myo for stealing the horn if Muftak's bet with bounty hunter [[Djas Puhr]] (that Solo survive the day) didn't pan out.<ref name="The Kloo Horn Cantina Caper" /> While waiting, she ordered a drink from Wuher at Chalmun's and shared it with Muftak. A few minutes later, she witnessed [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Luke Skywalker]] fight with [[Doctor|Dr.]] [[Cornelius Evazan]] and [[Ponda Baba]]. Shortly thereafter, Solo shot Greedo.<ref name="A New Hope" />

==Personality and traits==
{{Quote|Some little&hellip; bat weasel? I don't know. Like an Ugnaught with a gland issue or somethin'. I thought he was a really hairy kid at first.''"<br />"''She. Kabe.|The Scrapper and [[Myo]]|<ref name="The Kloo Horn Cantina Caper" />}}
[[File:Kabe_Databank.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Kabe reaches for a drink]]
Kabe used her high-pitched squeaks as an effective way to get the attention of Chalmun's Cantina [[bartender]], [[Wuher]]. She was a female Chadra-Fan, a [[species]] that averaged out at a height of 1 [[meter]].<ref name="Chadra-Fan" /> She had tan skin covered with brown [[Hair|fur]] and dark [[eye]]s.<ref name="A New Hope" />

